<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following production and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for September 23-29 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		Sept 23-29  Sept 25-Oct 1    TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		     1996	   1995	    1996	    1995</p>
<p> Stocks/open    364,341.6   215,596.9</p>
<p> Production	42,842.9    32,235.8    480,682.8   285,124.2</p>
<p> Shipment	  39,733.4     7,431.7    279,247.5   193,848.2</p>
<p> Home Market	  247.0	 337.3	 3,679.0    5,262.5</p>
<p> Stocks/close   364,341.6   240,063.7</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
